# Internal working notes. NEXT_STEPS is committed (see CLAUDE.md) — this repo is
# private, and a tracker only one checkout can see is a tracker the next session
# cannot read. AUTOMATIONS stays local: it is a scratchpad of enforcement ideas,
# not shared open work.
#
# Before making this repo public, both files must be dealt with — NEXT_STEPS is
# in git history by then, so removing it from HEAD is not enough.
/docs/AUTOMATIONS.md

# Skeleton sync state. Local to whoever bootstrapped this checkout (it records
# an absolute path on their machine), so it is kept out of the public repo.
/.skeleton.json

# Go CLI build output
/cli/dist/
